HST Office Start Center: HASON TECH solutions banner with clickable solution buttons, three editors, no donation UI.

- The donation banner area shows the HASON TECH solutions banner on every start while
  Misc/ShowDonation is enabled (upstream: every 30 days). The artwork (HS mark and headline,
  no solution names) ships as the custom brand image donate1.png (2x pixels, drawn at half
  size). Next to it, each solution (AIOS, eChatbot, Zalo Mini App, HST SEO, HST Post,
  AI Dễ Lắm) is its own GtkButton: keyboard focusable, accessible name = solution name,
  tooltip = tagline, opening its own URL. Names, taglines and URLs mirror
  data/hst/solutions.json. Donation texts and the right image are gone. Below the grid a
  flat text link "Xem thêm các giải pháp khác →" opens https://hasontech.vn (same UTM).
  Window narrower than 1100 px: the artwork is hidden, the buttons stay (3x2 grid).
- The hint in the empty recent-documents area ("Chào mừng đến với HST Office! Thả tài
  liệu vào đây...") is introductory text: Vietnamese in every UI language.
- The Start Center donation button is never shown; the Extensions button opens the
  Extension Manager (.uno:ExtensionManager), never a website.
- Each solution button opens its URL with
  ?utm_source=hst-office&utm_medium=start-center&utm_campaign=hst-office-1-0.
  The application sends no data; UTM only describes the user's click.
- "Create" buttons: only "_Text Document" / "_Spreadsheet" / "_Presentation"
  (vi: "_Văn bản" / "_Bảng tính" / "_Trình chiếu"); Draw, Math and Base buttons
  are hidden (those components stay installed for use inside the three editors).

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0; translations
under their upstream license). Test: Start Center screenshot under Xvfb.
